ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971390/extras/90fc110459feb52bfd189baecd433421.poster.avif?t=1744219426\" width=300 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971390/extras/90fc110459feb52bfd189baecd433421.webm?t=1744219426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971390/extras/a03b0749dbb616305719e5b996dbe9d5.poster.avif?t=1744219426\" width=530 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971390/extras/a03b0749dbb616305719e5b996dbe9d5.webm?t=1744219426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a medieval fantasy world, beautifully rendered in pixel art, music by\u00a0Andrew Goodwin. Expand your <strong>collection</strong> by uncovering every prism, rune, and relic during runs. <strong>Challenge</strong> yourself and your friends by recording the highest attack, amassing the largest gold amount, or mastering your favorite prism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember your ultimate goal : to <strong>free Fortuna</strong>, unjustly imprisoned in Tartarus !</p>",
